  Dependencies injected via constructor (lines 70-82): `ClinicService`, `OwnerMapper`, `PetMapper`, `VisitMapper`, `OwnerFieldsValidator`, `TelephoneNormalizer`. Other signatures: `listOwners`, `getOwner`, `updateOwner`, `deleteOwner`, `addPetToOwner`, `updateOwnersPet`, `addVisitToOwner`, `getOwnersPet`.
