### 4. Service layer
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicService.java` (interface) — owner methods at lines 56-61: `findOwnerById`, `findAllOwners`, `findOwners(String, Pageable)`, `saveOwner`, `deleteOwner`, `findOwnerByLastName`.

`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/service/ClinicServiceImpl.java` — holds `private final OwnerRepository ownerRepository` (line 45). `saveOwner` (lines 232-237) is `@Transactional` and just delegates to `ownerRepository.save(owner)`. No duplicate/telephone checks here.

